\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Entered the holy place above,
\par Covered with meritorious scars,
\par The tokens of His dying love
\par Our great High-priest in glory bears;
\par He pleads His passion on the tree,
\par He shows Himself to God for me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Before the throne my Saviour stands,
\par My Friend and Advocate appears;
\par My name is graven on His hands,
\par And Him the Father always hears;
\par While low at Jesu's Cross I bow,
\par He hears the blood of sprinkling now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. This instant now I may receive
\par The answer of His powerful prayer;
\par This instant now by Him I live,
\par His prevalence with God declare;
\par And soon my spirit, in His hands,
\par Shall stand where my Forerunner stands.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

